{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/780560-cats-from-saturn","id":780560,"title":"Cats from Saturn","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-05T08:20:55-08:00","id":780560,"title":"Cats from Saturn","content":"In my Corax chronicle the characters are about to be sent on an Umbral quest to the moon. I'm going to be stealing quite heavily from the Dream Quest of Unknown Kadath and plan to have them opposed by the Cats from Saturn. I would appreciate suggestions on appropriate stats and charms for the Cats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1456-zeke-hubris","name":"Zeke Hubris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-05T11:06:58-08:00","id":780623,"title":"","content":"We do not have much to go on for them. Just that they are large, peculiar, and multi-hued; they like the Dark Side of the Moon; and that Earth cats fear them.<br /> <br /> In WoD terms, they appear to be some sort of Bane that originiates from the Deep Umbra or Malfeas. Or if we take Moon to be associated with Arcadia, some kind of Fae Fomorian in service to the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> Themes could include mystery, unknown, and danger of solar flares (since Moon is not protected as Earth is - and may account for their multi-hue aspect). I would assign Charms and stats based on that; a deep umbral predator bane that prevents Gaian spirits and creatures from learning secrets of the Wyrm, or just keeping them off the dark side of the moon in general. Likely high in Rage and Gnosis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T05:12:29-08:00","id":781077,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking something like this for the stat block currently:<br /> <br /> Willpower: 6<br /> Rage: 7<br /> Gnosis: 7<br /> Essence: 18<br /> Charms: Armour, Blast (Flame)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1456-zeke-hubris","name":"Zeke Hubris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T07:21:44-08:00","id":781124,"title":"","content":"I would love a Corax chronicle. Any chance of a brief description of the characters and how they differ from each other and the goal of the game? <br /> <br /> I also dont know much about the Cats of Saturn. But I like the mix of having the dark side of the moon being something of Dream and the Wyrm (possibly Malfean) hiding in the darkness from Helios' light and the observstions of others. Very Wyrm and very Bastet-ish.<br /> <br /> I guess I'd imagine a mockery of a landscape. Fungal forrests that move and produce different spectrums of colors should light or glowing eye gifts be a thing (perhaps for the Cats). Where the growths and plants produce hallucinogenic effects to be dark nightmares and portents and the cats hunt through the cold desolate for prey to induce through the nightmares and learn from their visions of tornent while grinning maniacally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T09:17:08-08:00","id":781163,"title":"","content":"I currently have three characters in the chronicle. Corby Renshaw who is a tough, wise-cracking, hard drinking type who prefers to hit problems rather than solve them, her younger brother Jack who left university after finishing his Comp. Sci degree, provides the brains of the group and is studying hedge magic. The final member of the party is their cousin Otis who is a charming scoundrel with his fingers in all kinds of criminal enterprises and a dubious past. The chronicle is very loosely based upong the TV series Supernatural, with the characters travelling the country investigating strange goings on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1456-zeke-hubris","user":"Zeke Hubris","date":". 12-06-2015, 03:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1456-zeke-hubris","name":"Zeke Hubris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T10:56:12-08:00","id":781206,"title":"","content":"Cool. Hope they and you have a lot of fun ^-^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}